menu "Zigbee-Thermocouple"

config THERMOCOUPLE_MEASUREMENT_INTERVAL_S
    int "Measurement interval in seconds"
    range 10 4200
    default 3600
    help
        Interval for the measurement of the thermocouple temperature.
        The MCP9600 is in shutdown mode between the measurements, so a longer interval
        saves power. The maximum is limited by the ZBOSS alarm (overflow after approx. 71 minutes).

config THERMOCOUPLE_BATTERY_INTERVAL_S
    int "Battery measurement interval in seconds"
    range 60 604800
    default 86400
    help
        Interval for the measurement of the battery voltage. The battery is measured
        together with the temperature, so the effective interval is a multiple of
        THERMOCOUPLE_MEASUREMENT_INTERVAL_S. Default is once per day.

endmenu

source "Kconfig.zephyr"
